{"id":"n23402-1-17","stage":1,"title":"빵 · 面包","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23402-1-17-1","ko":"할 일이 많은데 점심은 어떻게 하지?","zh":"事情这么多，午饭要怎么办呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많은데","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"점심은","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지?","meaning":"吃，喝","explanation":"하다：吃，喝；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，作，置办；吃，喝","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"制作或准备什么东西。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/ad9f935c2c8d3b79297c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23402-1-17-2","ko":"간단히 빵으로 때우자.","zh":"简单吃点面包对付吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"간단히","meaning":"简单地，简便地","explanation":"간단히：简单地，简便地","readings":[{"term":"간단히","audio":"/audio/f496a22a97668f1f9dbf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16200","senseId":"2","lemma":"간단히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빵으로","meaning":"面包","explanation":"빵：面包；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"빵","audio":"/audio/edc73c627b8f32b7f6a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23402","senseId":"1","lemma":"빵","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때우자.","meaning":"对付，顶，替","explanation":"때우다：对付，顶，替；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"때우다","audio":"/audio/c84920cb18f316753902.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50393","senseId":"2","lemma":"때우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f496a22a97668f1f","term":"간단히","zh":"简单地，简便地","audio":"/audio/f496a22a97668f1f9dbf.mp3","entryId":"16200","definition":"不繁琐或不多地。","pronunciation":["간단히"]},{"id":"edc73c627b8f32b7","term":"빵","zh":"面包","audio":"/audio/edc73c627b8f32b7f6a1.mp3","entryId":"23402","definition":"将面粉揉和并使之发酵后，蒸或烤而成的食物。","pronunciation":["빵"]},{"id":"c84920cb18f31675","term":"때우다","zh":"对付，顶，替","audio":"/audio/c84920cb18f316753902.mp3","entryId":"50393","definition":"用简单的食物代替正餐。","pronunciation":["때우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b7aa9d9a7b0d91fd4c55.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.425,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=23402","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.7024,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["简单吃点面包对付吧。","事情这么多，午饭要怎么办呢？","客人，您要点餐吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["事情这么多，午饭要怎么办呢？","客人，您要点餐吗？","简单吃点面包对付吧。"],"answer":2}]}
